# Assault Formation changes only "each creature you control": Bot2's Dark Confidant (2/1) still assigns combat damage equal
# to its power. Bot1 has the Formation on turn 1; on turn 4 the Confidant attacks and Bot1 takes 2, not its toughness of 1
# (CR 510.1a).

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Assault Formation
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Dark Confidant
Swamp x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Assault Formation.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Dark Confidant.Cast
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Attack(Dark Confidant > Bot1)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

